Package: morphdown
Title: Programmatically Change R Markdown Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ricardo", "Semião", , "ricardo.semiao@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Programmatically change the structure of markdown files.
    Process a markdown file into a comprehensible list of blocks, and
    apply changes to each, through a plan that is efficient and robust to
    changes in the original file.
